{
  "name": "opencode-session-spawn",
  "version": "2.6.0",
  "type": "module",
  "description": "opencode 会话生成原语（V1+V2 双模兼容）：创建新顶层会话并注入起始语句、向指定会话注入消息、只读列举派生会话，用于无人值守长任务编排（V1：工具 spawn_session / notify_parent / notify_session / list_sessions + 命令 @spawn；V2：工具 spawn_session / notify_parent / notify_session + 命令 /spawn）。",
  "main": "index.js",
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "package.json",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "opencode",
    "plugin",
    "session",
    "spawn",
    "orchestration",
    "unattended"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/Qiu-Kejian/opencode-session-spawn.git"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=18"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@opencode-ai/plugin": "*"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@opencode-ai/plugin": "^1.1.36"
  }
}
